<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb attacks injured two police officers in Thailand's south, prompting tighter security and increased border intelligence. Cambodia is hosting ASEAN observers along the Cambodia-Thailand border, raising the dispute at international forums and receiving US support pledges from Hun Manet, who thanked Trump. Myanmar’s military leader Min Aung Hlaing accused Thailand of aiding illegal border trade, while a $3 million project will train 4,500 Myanmar refugees for Thai jobs. Malaysia is funding a RM200 million rail link to the border, but Thailand’s connection remains pending. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE5aMHhPLWVaSzIwVDQ4cW9ON0pCN0N4WjJQNHJvc0VNODViYWVJX0J0cUJVQTRDcGVrbUozWmh4OUtCVVJ6WWFxVXVfX0pCaGtVNHR2NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;អង្គភាព​ព័ត៌មាន​ និងប្រតិកម្មរហ័ស&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPQmxpVTNKYng1NnZwR09GdTFqS2I1MWRfMmJ3SHZKYmNTclB6SFRwV1RUNnhza25IcWZqRzBWVEp3a0ZlWEJFcUhianlTOExyai01ZjcwNG5ydm9FZnN1TC1KLXFMUUlvQ29rYUFVTlFUX2trdkN0SnpjZEkxUFZFZmxmaldWQS1rRHdDamNNbW83ZWZveDJremVtWDQzZlVvbDY4Y3dtckY3VjgzcHAzNnByLTZscXBPT182YjJxdXVGYkdkbWdjV3pHWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Voice of ASIA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQVlJ6aFNXUEVfVTVaSUtRU1pwRF9NMWZrRnlfaTRLTWJlTEVRTnRUS1R3a0wwOGlZUlJKbXFsdHBfRWJhR3dQc3M4UEh6QTE1TGQ2NGR2R3MzMElOeGc1R0p2OHRVZ1ZVQ2ZlQTlmS2ROeTNKdTJPclkxa1FMVlEyNnF5NkJ2ZjlLbWpDd0J4cHJlMm1H?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNeUVqajNPWXM5VzdVSXFxTjVzbHJoYWJ6bERWVFo4cXlTWXd5S2lXWlNPUGtNZmFVSlZ4ZTZZR2ZSZS1HUDcyNVZoaTQya0FybDBWRi1na2pFMzhwSFpRSjduek5jWGhKdkZaem9TTVlZRXZsYmxOLVpoWWxzS25kZllSeUw0OWZta20xbGZHbW5fTnNIZlVKTUJDTU9wSF82QkJDQT